; :361+ mock_1 weather / mock_2 email rows. Our run's load.log: `Error loading dataset: ... gated dataset ... Falling back to mock dataset`. probe.json dataset_len=2 and dataset_example id=mock_1.","user_impact":"Default load_environment() (num_examples=100) gives a 2-row toy set (SF weather, send email) instead of 100 xLAM examples. An explicit token argument overrides HF_TOKEN, so a user with a valid token still gets the mock rows. Eval scores are computed on 2 trivial prompts with no error raised.","batch":"HollowReview1"}],"hollow":{"key":"alaminai__agent_prompt_eval_v2","flags":"swallowed_dataset","details":"agent_prompt_eval_v2.py:356 except swallows dataset load"},"gold_review":[],"has_src":false,"logs":[]}